{"abstract":"I podcasten 24 spørgsmål til professoren maner Jens Olaf Pepke Pedersen til besindighed, når det gælder klimaforandringer. Dejligt at høre – men desværre i modstrid med den etablerede klimaforskning.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Appel Olsen, Frederik","Pøhler, Jesper Dalgaard","Toft, Maria","Ejsing, Mads","Jensen, Søren Mark","Bjerre, Liv","Papazu, Irina","Fals, Katinka Bundgård"],"cuid":["S02-092.16-716027"],"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Pøhler, Jesper Dalgaard"],"keyword":["Bæredygtighed","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Forskningsformidling","IPCC","Klima","mediedebat","mediekritik"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kontroverser hvor der er konsensus","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.weekendavisen.dk/2023-41/ideer/kontroverser-hvor-der-er-konsensus","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-092.16-716027","ids":["au-8746c102-ee8c-4f42-b180-d179cd861283","ku-b26dbca1-3c00-4e0f-bd65-93f97d8f9442"],"keyword":["Det Humanistiske Fakultet","IPCC","bæredygtighed","forskningsformidling","klima","mediedebat","mediekritik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-ED07C346E3529D5B8C843A2B9013517C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-