{"abstract":"Når regeringen negligerer klimaforskning, er det ikke kun skadeligt, fordi det hæmmer vores evne til at handle på klimakrisen nu og her. Det risikerer også at spænde ben for den fremtidige udvikling af netop den viden, vi skal bruge","author_count":13,"contributors":["Fals, Katinka Bundgård","Quistgaard, Thea","Almlund, Pernille","Ejsing, Mads","Papazu, Irina","Christensen, Søren","Pøhler, Jesper Dalgaard","Toft, Maria","Christiansen, Kirstine Lund","Weldingh, Line","Salling, Caroline Anna","Fiig, Natasha Gjerløv","Horn, Laura"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-717361"],"filters":{"added":"2024-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"regeringen afviser al klimaforskning der ikke passer ind i dens kram","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.information.dk/debat/2023/09/regeringen-afviser-al-klimaforskning-passer-dens-kram#comments-open","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-717361","ids":["au-2e2e332a-c510-478e-84e0-a3d918ff7cd8"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EFEA7A8F6E51A54B5AC7BCA60972CADE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.information.dk/debat/2023/09/regeringen-afviser-al-klimaforskning-passer-dens-kram#comments-open","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Environmental social science and geograph